OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of occasionally heavy rain,
OL,7,Fmainly over eastern counties with the
OL,8,Fwest generally drier. Staying rather
OL,9,Fcloudy overnight but the rain largely
OL,10,Ffading out by morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA quite cloudy start but
OL,13,Fbright or spells developing through
OL,14,Fthe day. Mostly dry but the chance of
OL,15,Fa few showers developing. Becoming
OL,16,Fquite breezy around the Antrim coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
