OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FRain
OL,6,For showers at times, perhaps heavy and
OL,7,Fthundery. Occasional drier and
OL,8,Fbrighter spells. Light or moderate
OL,9,Fwinds, likely freshening on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
